      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHALLOW SALLY (2) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 6th at this track in Grade 5 H company. Can make amends. LEKTRA SOLO (4) showed good pace from out wide and was prominent early but began to paddle and faded out of it when 8th at Sandown in Grade 5 NP company. Has a good record here at this journey. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Must be included in calculations. CACKLING SUZIE (5) was a Grade 5 winner (22.24) two back then found trouble in the run and fell at this track last time. Has the ability and can measure up. DIMORA BIG BOY (1) is coming off a sharp 22.24 success last time. Can measure up again.",
